# NESter SDL3 Frontend

Graphical frontend for our NES emulator, written in C using SDL3.

## Requirements

- C11-compatible compiler
- CMake 3.21 or newer
- Ninja or another supported build system
- Git and internet access for downloading SDL3

## Build

cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja
cmake --build build

## Run

Windows:
.\build\NESter.exe

Linux/macOS:
./build/NESter

## Current Functionality

- Creates an SDL3 application window
- Processes window-close events

## Planned Integration

- PPU framebuffer rendering
    - We need to decided on a framebuffer format
- Controller input mapping
- APU audio output